[TITLE]
synthetic: [LID_RICHARDS], every branch of lidnode::readRichards

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE

[LID_RICHARDS]
;; ahead of its control: deferred, replayed after the later OPTIONS row (duplicate then)
